From 37d017b1da8c8fe2342ee7f947508f8ac957b934 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 14:49:40 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(xtask): join the UI config directory by components for
 Windows

plan_notes built the UI directory as root.join("crates/ui"). On Windows
the "/" stays in the path, so the noted config path had mixed
separators. The test built its expected path the same way but with a
different split, and the two strings did not match on Windows.

Join "crates" and "ui" as two components in plan_notes and in the test.
A source pin keeps the production join in that form; it fails on Linux
too, where the separator mismatch cannot show.

Fixes #4454

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
